---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {profile} from '../data/profile';
import {localUrl} from '../data/urls';
---
<Layout>
<section class="home-hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> DATA ANALYTICS & DATA SCIENCE</p><h1>Making data<br/><em>mean something.</em></h1><p class="hero-intro">Hi, I’m {profile.name}.</p><p class="hero-description">{profile.bio}</p><a class="text-link" href="#explore">Explore my work <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="portrait-panel">{profile.photo ? <img class="portrait" src={localUrl(profile.photo)} alt={profile.name}/> : <div class="portrait-placeholder" aria-label="Portrait placeholder"><span class="portrait-monogram">dg<span>.</span></span><span class="portrait-caption">DAKSHESH GAUTAM / DATA PORTFOLIO</span></div>}<div class="portrait-label"><span>Two perspectives.<br/>One curious mind.</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></div></section>
<section id="explore" class="container explore"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / EXPLORE THE WORK</p><p>Choose the perspective that fits your role.</p></div><div class="track-grid"><a class="track-card analytics-track" href={localUrl('data-analytics/')}><div class="track-top"><span class="eyebrow">INSIGHT & DECISION-MAKING</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="mini-chart" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><h2>Data Analytics</h2><p>Clean data. Clear dashboards.<br/>Answers that help decisions.</p><span class="track-link">Explore analytics portfolio <span>→</span></span></a><a class="track-card science-track" href={localUrl('data-science/')}><div class="track-top"><span class="eyebrow">MODELS & EXPERIMENTATION</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="mini-network" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><h2>Data Science</h2><p>Thoughtful experiments.<br/>Models built to be questioned.</p><span class="track-link">Explore science portfolio <span>→</span></span></a></div></section>
<section class="container education"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / EDUCATION & LEARNING</p><h2>A foundation.<br/><em>Always growing.</em></h2><p>Structured learning, strengthened through practical projects.</p></div><div class="education-records">{profile.education.map(e=><article><p class="eyebrow">{e.period}</p><h3>{e.degree}</h3><p>{e.institution}</p><p>{e.description}</p><ul>{e.highlights.map(h=><li>{h}</li>)}</ul></article>)}<article><span class="education-date">2026</span><h3>IBM Data Analyst</h3><p>Professional Certificate · Coursera</p><p>11 completed courses covering Excel, SQL, Python, dashboards, and a capstone project.</p><a class="text-link" href={localUrl('data-analytics/#certifications')}>Explore credential & courses ↗</a></article><article><span class="education-date">2026</span><h3>IBM Data Science</h3><p>Professional Certificate · Coursera</p><p>12 completed courses covering data science methodology, Python, SQL, machine learning, and applied projects.</p><a class="text-link" href={localUrl('data-science/#certifications')}>Explore credential & courses ↗</a></article>{profile.education.length===0 && <p class="pending-content">Academic education details will be added here.</p>}</div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact container"><p class="eyebrow">03 / LET’S CONNECT</p><h2>Have a data question?<br/><em>Let’s start there.</em></h2><div class="contact-links">{profile.email && <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Email me ↗</a>}{profile.linkedin && <a href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>}<a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find me on GitHub ↗</a></div></section>
</Layout>
